{"4052840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AINUR", "steam_appid": 4052840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">AINUR is an open-world survival and building game set in a fictional fantasy wasteland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Centered on the core themes of &quot;survival and reconstruction,&quot; it utilizes an in-game &quot;deep construction system&quot; to alter the state of the game world, unlock storylines, and combat natural calamities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052840/extras/897e00fbdde006e5cf838275b61f26e3.avif?t=1775955454\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052840/extras_big/897e00fbdde006e5cf838275b61f26e3.webp?t=1775955454 width=1560 height=1274 /></span>The world of AINUR presents a dark future: humanity once stood at the peak of its civilization, but ordinary people failed to benefit from its development, ultimately plunging the empire into civil war and destroying it. After the war, the player character is hunted down by the remnants of the imperial forces because of their identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this land filled with mutant creatures and rebels, on one hand there is the spreading otherworldly crisis; on the other, various factions rise from hatred, competing for the direction of human civilization. The player must unite this world already torn apart by hatred and build a new kingdom atop the ruins.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052840/extras/e976e3eb84187cffe767e5d4f2845698.avif?t=1775955454\" width=1286 height=725 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 